		"description": "<p>Learn the <strong>Lifebinding Spirit</strong> cantrip.</p><p><strong>Mend.</strong> 1 Action: (WIL/Safe Rest, Reach 4) Your Lifebinding Spirit restores WIL d20 HP to a Dying creature.</p><p>[A] Using this feature Mends: it spends 1 charge from the <em>Mend</em> pool (WIL/Safe Rest, adjustable with the sheet's +/-) and rolls the healing.</p><p>[M] Your Lifebinding Spirit rolls twice as many dice at level 20 (Twilight Sage).</p>",
